	(text "NOR true table:\nA    B      Y    High voltage\n0    0      1          ON\n0    1      0         OFF\n1    0      0         OFF\n1    1      0         OFF\nThreshold 0.8V\nThe board will not work unless interlock is held low.\nAlso the uC needs to pull down the ~{EN} pin to turn on\nthe high voltage"
